Import Qwen Image 2.1 models

Accept Comfy's fused img_mlp.gate_up.  Shift the zero-centred
txt_in.text_norm in the importer rather than in QwenImage2_1's mapper,
because LoRAImporter writes LoRA deltas through that mapper.  Keep
context_norm raw in the quantizer, as the catalog's q6p does.
